  sh:description "This property refers to the centre that is responsible for the record.The PROV ontology indicates that \"Attribution is the ascribing of an entity to an agent.\" This fits with the intended meaning of the link between the record and the ISSN centre, since ISSN records can be re-attributed between ISSN centres, so the ISSN centre referred to by this property cannot be said to be the \"creator\" or the \"author\" of the record."@en;
